          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"public-sector-opportunity-pipeline\">Public-sector Opportunity Pipeline</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Explore a deterministic, incremental two-source pipeline built from fictional\nrecords. Every row is normalized, validated, versioned, merged, scored with\nvisible rules, and represented in a content-hashed run manifest.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">No live procurement endpoint, contact data, credential, or employer system is\nused. Scores are additive screening rules, not suitability probabilities.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
